<title>UK: Bausch &amp; Lomb creates 500 jobs in Scotland.</title>
<headline>Bausch &amp; Lomb creates 500 jobs in Scotland.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bausch &amp; Lomb Inc., the world's largest eyecare company, said it planned to create 500 jobs in Scotland at its Award Plc contact lens subsidiary.</p>
<p>The jobs will be created over the next three years at Award, which is responsible for developing one-day disposal soft contact lenses.</p>
<p>Bausch &amp; Lomb said a new facility would be set up near its existing 300-job plant in Livingston to enable Award to expand production.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
